    `the contravention of the order is also a contempt of court` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the contravention of the order also a contempt of court?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 137E(10) subsection (9) does not affect the court's powers in relation to the punishment of contempt` MEANS
    IF `the contravention of the order is also a contempt of court`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in relation to the punishment of contempt of the court"; a contravention that is not a contempt is outside the subsection
